.TH NOXFORGE-CTL 1 "October 2026" "NoxForge 18.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
noxforge-ctl \- NoxForge Unified Control Hub and Orchestration Suite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B noxforge-ctl
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B noxforge-ctl
is the unified command-line and graphical control suite for the NoxForge desktop visual system.
It orchestrates profile switching (Graphite <-> Obsidian), accent color management with WCAG AA
validation, system-wide desktop synchronization, diurnal Day/Night scheduling, third-party
developer tool theme deployment, and launches the NoxForge Control Center GUI.
.PP
By default, without subcommands,
.B noxforge-ctl
displays the current desktop profile, active color scheme, Plasma style, Aurorae decoration,
KWin switcher layout, and accent color.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BR switch " [" graphite | obsidian "]"
Switch between standard Graphite gray surfaces and true OLED pitch-black Obsidian.
Supports \fB-n\fR (\fB--dry-run\fR) and \fB--json\fR.
.TP
.BR sync " [\fB--profile\fR " graphite | obsidian "]"
Synchronize all desktop layers (Plasma, GTK 3/4, icons, cursors, sounds, widget styles).
.TP
.BR accent " [" lime | cyan | violet | amber | system | custom | \fI#RRGGBB\fR "]"
Set the active Forge accent color or a custom hex code. Custom accents enforce WCAG AA (4.5:1)
minimum contrast against both dark graphite (#141E25) and OLED obsidian (#000000).
Also non-destructively updates user GTK 3/4 accent overrides.
.TP
.BR status
Display the current NoxForge desktop profile and component state.
.TP
.BR schedule " [" \-\-enable " | " \-\-disable " | " \-\-status " | " \-\-apply\-now "]"
Manage automated Day/Night profile switching via systemd user timers.
\fB--enable\fR accepts optional \fB--day-time\fR \fIHH:MM\fR (default 07:00) and
\fB--night-time\fR \fIHH:MM\fR (default 20:00). \fB--apply-now\fR evaluates the current
local time against the schedule (including midnight wrap-around schedules) and switches profile.
.TP
.BR motion " [" \-\-status " | " \-\-reduced " | " \-\-standard "]"
Inspect or toggle system-wide Reduced Motion across KDE Plasma (\fBAnimationDurationFactor\fR)
and GNOME/GTK (\fBenable-animations\fR).
.TP
.BR wallpaper " [" standard | obsidian | quiet | ultrawide | obsidian\-ultrawide " | " \-\-list "]"
Switch or list the active NoxForge desktop wallpaper variant across connected Plasma monitors.
.TP
.BR export " [\fB\-\-output\fR " \fIFILE\fR "]"
Export a portable JSON preset snapshot capturing profile, accent, opacity, motion, schedule,
Flatpak, and ecosystem state.
.TP
.BR import " " \fIFILE\fR
Import and apply a portable JSON preset snapshot created by \fBnoxforge-ctl export\fR.
.TP
.BR flatpak " [" \-\-enable " | " \-\-disable " | " \-\-status "]"
Manage user Flatpak overrides (\fBxdg-data/themes:ro\fR, \fBxdg-config/gtk-3.0:ro\fR, \fBxdg-config/gtk-4.0:ro\fR)
so sandboxed GTK 3, GTK 4, and Libadwaita applications adopt the active NoxForge theme and accent.
.TP
.BR ecosystem " [" status " | " apply " [" \fIapp\fR | all "] | " restore " [" \fIapp\fR | all "] ]"
Audit, deploy, or restore NoxForge theme configurations for user application directories
(Alacritty, Kitty, Ghostty, Foot, btop, Neovim, Helix, Zed, VS Code, Discord, Firefox, Starship, Fastfetch).
\fBapply\fR creates automatic \fB.noxforge.bak\fR backups and tracks deployed apps in
\fB~/.config/noxforge/ecosystem-state.json\fR for reactive profile and accent synchronization;
\fBrestore\fR restores original user configurations.
.TP
.BR opacity " [" \fIargs\fR... "]"
Configure panel, popup, and window decoration transparency levels via \fBnoxforge-opacity\fR.
.TP
.BR doctor " [" \fIargs\fR... "]"
Run the read-only NoxForge system diagnostics and verification via \fBnoxforge-doctor\fR.
.TP
.BR gui
Launch the interactive PySide6 / Qt 6 NoxForge Control Center GUI.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show program version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message and exit.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR noxforge-doctor (1),
.BR noxforge-opacity (1)
